   "type": "text",
   "text": "THE OUTWARD GATE\n\nlore never crosses to a shared audience by copy, export or\npackaging. Only by AUTHORED RE-HOMING with a recorded\ngraduation block (source_address, stage, owner, date,\nwarrant).\n\nRenaming or rewrapping is LAUNDERING.",
